        faq('What are the largest data centre projects in India?', 'Announced gigawatt-scale campuses include Google’s AI hub in Visakhapatnam (about US$15 billion over 2026 to 2030) and Reliance’s multi-gigawatt build at Jamnagar. Cushman & Wakefield maps more than 4 GW of early-stage or announced capacity in Visakhapatnam alone.', 'google', 'reliance-ai', 'ii-cw'),
